      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "追加工作的截止日期，在座谈会当天。\n这样下去，我缺席的可能性很大……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcd1bb09697fa92fae5696105ce11782026318a38b1db7b144aec9769fc4ef2b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
